   "id": 673863,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "As individuals move through emerging adulthood, they often explore their sexual identity and orientation. In this essay, examine how social and cultural factors, such as community acceptance, family support, and media portrayals, influence this process. Reflect on the complexities that individuals face during this stage of development, particularly when their sexual orientation or identity challenges societal norms. Consider how individuals navigate these challenges and how the acceptance or rejection they encounter shapes their overall well-being and identity formation.",
